# What the image builds never need (the root Dockerfile copies the repository after this list).

# Dependencies and build output: the images install and build their own.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/next-env.d.ts
.pnpm-store

# Local data, history, documentation and editor files
.local
docs
.git
.claude
.vscode
.idea
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log

# Settings and secrets: never in an image. Only the committed example.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example

# Test reports and coverage
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/blob-report
